# California Housing Price Prediction

## Overview
A Machine Learning regression project to predict median house values in California using the California Housing dataset.

## Technologies Used
- Python
- NumPy, Pandas
- Matplotlib, Seaborn
- Scikit-learn

## Models Implemented
- Linear Regression (OLS)
- Ridge Regression (L2)
- Lasso Regression (L1)

## Key Steps
- Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
- Data Preprocessing
- Missing Value Imputation
- Feature Engineering
- Correlation Analysis
- Hyperparameter Tuning using GridSearchCV
- Model Evaluation

## Results

| Model | RMSE | R² Score |
|---|---:|---:|
| OLS | 68,917.32 | 0.6375 |
| Ridge | 68,925.96 | 0.6375 |
| Lasso | 68,918.68 | 0.6375 |

**Best Model:** OLS Regression (based on test RMSE).


